,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;context-menu-groups&#x22;}]\"></mdx-jsx>\n<h2 id=\"icons\">Icons</h2>\n<p>Combine icons with labels for quick scanning.</p>\n<mdx-jsx data-name=\"ComponentPreview\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;styleName&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;base-nova&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;name&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;context-menu-icons&#x22;}]\"></mdx-jsx>\n<h2 id=\"checkboxes\">Checkboxes</h2>\n<p>Use <code>ContextMenuCheckboxItem</code> for toggles.</p>\n<mdx-jsx data-name=\"ComponentPreview\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;styleName&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;base-nova&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;name&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;context-menu-checkboxes&#x22;}]\"></mdx-jsx>\n<h2 id=\"radio\">Radio</h2>\n<p>Use <code>ContextMenuRadioItem</code> for exclusive choices.</p>\n<mdx-jsx data-name=\"ComponentPreview\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;styleName&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;base-nova&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;name&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;context-menu-radio&#x22;}]\"></mdx-jsx>\n<h2 id=\"destructive\">Destructive</h2>\n<p>Use <code>variant=\"destructive\"</code> to style the menu item as destructive.</p>\n<mdx-jsx data-name=\"ComponentPreview\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;styleName&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;base-nova&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;name&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;context-menu-destructive&#x22;}]\"></mdx-jsx>\n<h2 id=\"sides\">Sides</h2>\n<p>Control submenu placement with side and align props.</p>\n<mdx-jsx data-name=\"ComponentPreview\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;styleName&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;base-nova&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;name&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;context-menu-sides&#x22;}]\"></mdx-jsx>\n<h2 id=\"rtl\">RTL</h2>\n<p>To enable RTL support in shadcn/ui, see the <a href=\"/docs/rtl\">RTL configuration guide</a>.</p>\n<mdx-jsx data-name=\"ComponentPreview\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;styleName&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;base-nova&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;name&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;context-menu-rtl&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;direction&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;rtl&#x22;}]\"></mdx-jsx>\n<p>Use <code>side=\"inline-end\"</code> to place the menu on the logical right side of the trigger.</p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1f2328;--shiki-dark-bg:#101010;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"tsx\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\"><code __raw__=\"<ContextMenu>\n  <ContextMenuTrigger>Right click here</ContextMenuTrigger>\n  <ContextMenuContent side=&#x22;inline-end&#x22;>\n    <ContextMenuItem>Profile</ContextMenuItem>\n    <ContextMenuItem>Billing</ContextMenuItem>\n    <ContextMenuItem>Team</ContextMenuItem>\n    <ContextMenuItem>Subscription</ContextMenuItem>\n  </ContextMenuContent>\n</ContextMenu>\" data-line-numbers=\"\" data-language=\"tsx\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\" style=\"display: grid;\" data-line-numbers-max-digits=\"1\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">ContextMenu</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">></span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">ContextMenuTrigger</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">></span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">Right click here</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">ContextMenuTrigger</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">></span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span styl